31:["$","div","Location, privacy and accuracy",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Location, privacy and accuracy"}],[["$","p","The tool asks for your location only when you pr",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"The tool asks for your location only when you press the “use my location” option, and your browser shows its own permission prompt. If you prefer not to share GPS, type an area or city instead; the search then uses geocoding and needs no permission."}],["$","p","Results come from map data and can be incomplete",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Results come from map data and can be incomplete or slightly out of date, especially in small towns and newly built areas. Always confirm opening hours, availability and the exact address by phone or on the provider’s own page before you travel."}]],null,null]}]
